SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 22 - The Sun Sets on Good Men and
 Outlaws Just the Same
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Morgan returns for another chapter of our Red Dead
 Redemption II adventure. The frontier is changing, the shadows are growing
 longer, and the difference between good men and outlaws isn't always as
 simple as the stories would have us believe. Another evening of incredible
 storytelling, difficult choices, and probably getting distracted by the
 scenery. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run.
 With federal agents and bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang
 must rob, steal, and fight their way across the rugged heartland in order
 to survive.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Cp6qFWFHQU
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
