DTSTAMP:20260926T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T000900Z
DTSTART:20261017T203000Z
DTEND:20261017T223000Z
SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 3 - Lovely Place,
 Shame About the Gates to Hell
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back to beautiful Cyrodiil, where the rolling
 countryside, ancient ruins, and charming towns are unfortunately
 interrupted by enormous flaming portals to another dimension. It's an
 absolutely lovely place to visit, provided you don't mind the occasional
 demonic invasion. Return to the province of Cyrodiil in a remastered
 version of the legendary open-world RPG. With the Emperor slain and
 mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll create our
 character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests, join factions,
 delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes Dagon.
 Whether we follow the main story or get completely distracted by side
 quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TRuFM7myqLo
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
