DTEND:20261018T223000Z
SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 86 - Tucker & Dale vs. Evil (2010)
DESCRIPTION:After surviving construction delays, financial
 responsibilities, wartime stealth missions, Christmas in October, outlaw
 trouble, and the gates of Oblivion, it's time to put down the controller
 and relax with the community for another Movie Night. Grab your favourite
 snacks, find somewhere comfortable, and join us for a chilled-out end to
 the week. Meet you all on Discord for Movie Night.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Movie Night
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24902211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261001T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T000900Z
DTSTART:20261022T203000Z
DTEND:20261022T223000Z
SUMMARY:Waterpark Simulator | Ep. 2 - Wet Pumpkins and Other Horrors
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back into Waterpark Simulator, and with
 Halloween rapidly approaching, things are getting appropriately strange.
 Wet pumpkins, questionable attractions, potentially horrifying health and
 safety standards, and the ongoing challenge of running a waterpark without
 accidentally creating a new form of aquatic nightmare. What could possibly
 go wrong? Dive into the fun of running your very own waterpark! Design and
 expand your park, build exciting pools and attractions, keep your guests
 happy, and deal with the chaos that comes with managing a busy summer
 destination. From creating the perfect waterpark to handling the
 unexpected, it's time to see if we can turn our park into the ultimate
 place for fun in the sun.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QMV1LfbhJz0
CATEGORIES:Waterpark Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
