SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 4 - Saving
 Cyrodiil Between Unnecessary Side Quests
DESCRIPTION:Cyrodiil is in danger, the Oblivion Gates are still causing
 problems, and the fate of the world may very well rest in our hands.
 Naturally, we've also got approximately seventeen unrelated errands to
 complete, several caves to investigate, and somebody in a nearby village
 who desperately needs help finding something they misplaced. Return to the
 province of Cyrodiil in a remastered version of the legendary open-world
 RPG. With the Emperor slain and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across
 the land, we'll create our character, explore towns and ancient ruins,
 take on quests, join factions, delve into dangerous dungeons and battle
 the forces of Mehrunes Dagon. Whether we follow the main story or get
 completely distracted by side quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting
 to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
