UID:stream-24952211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261006T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T000900Z
DTSTART:20261027T213000Z
DTEND:20261027T233000Z
SUMMARY: Halloween Black Witch 300 Piece Jigsaw Puzzles
DESCRIPTION: Relax and chat with a cosy Jigsaw Puzzle Night. Settle in for
 a cosy puzzle-building stream as we tackle a 300-piece Halloween jigsaw
 puzzle together on camera! This time we're piecing together a wonderfully
 autumnal scene featuring a witch and her black cat wandering through a
 glowing woodland filled with falling leaves and pumpkins, complete with
 the message Once upon a time there was a girl who really loved cats and
 Halloween. We'll sort the pieces, hunt for those elusive matches, chat
 along the way and slowly bring this colourful Halloween scene to life. No
 rush, no pressure-just a chilled-out puzzle session, plenty of
 conversation and hopefully the satisfaction of placing that final piece!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Jigsaw Puzzle
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
