SUMMARY: Edge Of Evil | Ep. 4
DESCRIPTION: Descend into a dark psychological horror adventure where the
 search for a lost kitten leads deep into an ancient pirate crypt. Explore
 hidden passages, disturb forgotten graves, solve cryptic puzzles, dig for
 clues and treasure, and defend yourself from undead shadow creatures
 lurking below. With an eerie atmosphere, immersive sound, fully voiced
 characters and a mystery surrounding a broken ancient seal, this is a
 journey where curiosity may take us far deeper than we ever intended.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Edge Of Evil
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
