DTSTART:20261031T213000Z
DTEND:20261031T233000Z
SUMMARY: The Lightkeeper | Long Play
DESCRIPTION: Step into the isolated life of Arthur, a World War I veteran
 who takes a job as a lighthouse keeper on a remote island in 1925. What
 begins as a seemingly peaceful escape soon descends into psychological
 horror as we maintain the lighthouse, manage essential supplies and
 explore the island while uncovering the disturbing truth behind the deaths
 of its previous keepers. With haunting surroundings, unsettling mysteries
 and multiple endings shaped by our choices, we'll have to discover what is
 real-and what may be waiting for us in the darkness.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Lightkeeper
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
